  "title": "Ribbed htr washcloth",
  "subtitle": "Front and back post half trebles make a stretchy ribbed washcloth.",
  "excerpt": "Alternating FPhtr and BPhtr in a 1x1 rib makes a washcloth that stretches across and recovers. Good for face washing where some give makes the cloth easier to hold.",
